String {
    key = "mechlopedia.vehicle.hetzer.description"
    text = "Commanders do well to heed the advice that the Hetzer wheeled assault gun is best destroyed from long range before it can engage its Heavy Autocannon. The prospect of facing down the torrential barrage of the Heavy Autocannon delivered from such a nimble platform should command the attention of every 'Mech pilot as soon as this vehicle shows up on sensor readouts.\n\nRelatively maneuverable and impervious to a first or even second direct hit, the Hetzer can knock 'Mechs out of commission if ignored too long."
    paragraphCount = 2
    paragraph0 = "Commanders do well to heed the advice that the Hetzer wheeled assault gun is best destroyed from long range before it can engage its Heavy Autocannon. The prospect of facing down the torrential barrage of the Heavy Autocannon delivered from such a nimble platform should command the attention of every 'Mech pilot as soon as this vehicle shows up on sensor readouts."
    paragraph1 = "Relatively maneuverable and impervious to a first or even second direct hit, the Hetzer can knock 'Mechs out of commission if ignored too long."
