String {
    key = "mechlopedia.vehicle.partisan.description"
    text = "A well-armored and powerful non-'Mech opponent, the Partisan's multiple rapid-firing Light Autocannons can inflict moderate damage on most 'Mechs.\n\nRelatively slow at 80 tons, the Partisan makes up for its late arrival and slow departure with well-stocked autocannon ammunition stores. Capable of delivering heavy fire support that can distract if not destroy 'Mechs as well as airborne threats, the Partisan acquits the armored cavalry well."
    paragraphCount = 2
    paragraph0 = "A well-armored and powerful non-'Mech opponent, the Partisan's multiple rapid-firing Light Autocannons can inflict moderate damage on most 'Mechs."
    paragraph1 = "Relatively slow at 80 tons, the Partisan makes up for its late arrival and slow departure with well-stocked autocannon ammunition stores. Capable of delivering heavy fire support that can distract if not destroy 'Mechs as well as airborne threats, the Partisan acquits the armored cavalry well."
