String {
    key = "mechlopedia.component.101_medium_autocannon.description"
    text = "The Light Autocannon fires shells 30 mm or larger and is effective out to long range. Used primarily on vehicles and tanks, the Light Autocannon occasionally sees duty mounted on 'Mechs designed to eliminate smaller, fast-moving threats.\n\nBelow-average armor penetration capability limits the Light Autocannon's effectiveness against 'Mechs."
